## Key Concepts
- Dynamic shortest paths under monotone updates
- Dijkstra-like propagation with lazy updates
- Priority queues vs bucketed approaches for integer weights
- Amortized analysis based on updated edges and affected nodes
- Memory footprint: O(N+M)

## Code Example
